Type: Compendium
Package: DetmerApalDemography
Title: Acropora palmata Size-Dependent Demography Synthesis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Detmer", role = "aut"),
    person("Stier", "Adrian", role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Description: Synthesis of Acropora palmata (Elkhorn Coral) demographic data
    across the Caribbean. Analyses include GAMs, GLMMs, random-effects
    meta-analysis, and Lefkovitch population projection models for
    size-dependent survival and growth in restored vs. natural populations.
